# Build a male orc rogue whose two class skill ranks both go to Move
# Silently, so the Move Silently vs Listen contest after invisibility has a
# fair chance. Everything else is chargen-rogue.keys verbatim.
#
# Included by sneak-invis-melee.keys and sneak-invis-ranged.keys; used only by
# tools/check_sneak_invis.sh (bead inc-nkf2). The seed still decides the
# attribute rolls, the offered feats and the Listen rolls.
a       # Create a New Character
n       # Alter the character generation options? -- no
y       # Explore Mode
@choose "Orc"
@choose "Orc (Standard)"
@choose "Rogue"
a       # attributes: first set
@choose "Neutral"
a       # first feat
a       # second feat

# Skill Manager: Move Silently first (its maximum at 1st level is two ranks).
@cursorto:mark "Move Silently" DOWN
RIGHT*2
# Drain the rest of the pool the way chargen-rogue.keys does.
RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN
RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN
ENTER y # Done, confirm keeping the ranks

y       # Do you wish to worship <god>? -- yes
a       # Personality archetype
